{
  "$comment": "AD-15: who owns every path. A file belongs to a team when it matches one of the team's globs and none of its '!' exclusions. tooling/arch-tests checks that every file in the repo has exactly one owner; `pnpm verify:scope <team> --base <ref>` fails when a team branch changes a file outside its globs. `regenerated` files are owned by the integrator but rewritten by tools on any branch (pnpm-lock.yaml after a team edits its own package.json), so verify:scope lets any team change them; the integrator re-resolves them on the integration branch and nobody hand-merges them (AD-15 rule 2).",
